<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 5,880.92 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 5,880.92 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's BUX index closed officially at 5,880.92 points, down 0.63 points, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 6.41 billion forints.</p>
<p>BUX futures settled higher, rising by between 20 and 112.50 points.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
